  "content": "<h2>更多座位</h2><p>也请看看我的其他模组：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-trainutilities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力：列车实用装置</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-train-lights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力：列车照明</a></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3b54ad5c623f7d9152857979f2b729e46bf43037_0.webp\" alt=\"标题\"></p><p>本模组为列车和装置添加了两种现代座椅。</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/DkcprwueFj\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discord.com/api/guilds/1248636479627071488/widget.png?style=banner2\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p><h2>依赖项</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力</a> / <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力（Fabric版）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farchitectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API</a></li>\n</ul><h2>特性</h2><h3>座椅展示</h3><div style=\"display:flex\"><img width=\"49.5%\" height=\"auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cec1b695a56c8ae174b68c82aff1ebda727d2de2.png\" alt=\"图一\"> <img style=\"margin-left:20px\" width=\"49.5%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e06f8c60af5519be8dd65913c929ae865858459b.png\" alt=\"图二\"></div><h3>全部变种</h3><div style=\"display:flex\"><img width=\"49.5%\" height=\"auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/73ec3efae79847b5485f99d860f7e114a8de746d.png\" alt=\"图一\"> <img style=\"margin-left:20px\" width=\"49.5%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/46b17ae41b62bd030493ea26dd8349e3049e1434.png\" alt=\"图二\"></div><h3>更多功能</h3><ul>\n<li>可在列车上使用</li>\n<li>可染色</li>\n</ul><h2>语言</h2><ul>\n<li>英语</li>\n</ul><h2>重要提示！</h2><p>安装模组更新前请务必备份您的存档，以免存档损坏。</p><h2>支持我</h2><p>如果您想支持我和我的工作，请访问我的Ko-fi页面 ❤️</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fadeptstack_programmerlp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-fi</a></li>\n</ul><h2>致谢</h2><p>感谢Vinicius M提供的视觉设计 :)</p>",
